{"id":"n66882-1-5","stage":5,"title":"앞장 · 前列","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66882-1-5-1","ko":"할머니, 우리 시장에 맛있는 음식을 먹으러 가요.","zh":"奶奶，我们去市场吃好吃的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶","explanation":"할머니：奶奶","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"2","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"시장에","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시장에","audio":"/audio/f6fa1597901d4733fb6a.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있는","audio":"/audio/5adc05669a4242e46918.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으러","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으러","audio":"/audio/3bc7725f95e57fc73de6.mp3"}},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的女性。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed0c3fa08c98b0dbc800.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66882-1-5-2","ko":"응, 그래. 나는 가게를 잘 모르니까 네가 앞장을 서 봐라.","zh":"好，我不熟悉那些店，你在前面带路吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"가게를","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게를","audio":"/audio/269fe7df5acfec8fb9d0.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르니까","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르니까","audio":"/audio/cd64f25f94a2d131cfa6.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"앞장을","meaning":"前列，前阵，前锋","explanation":"앞장：前列，前阵，前锋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"앞장","audio":"/audio/bc49f7a259c57acd9235.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66882","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞장을","audio":"/audio/603ac54e7f38debcf47e.mp3"}},{"text":"서","meaning":"站","explanation":"서다：站；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"14","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서","audio":"/audio/a5bc3484406e4a8fc29e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐라.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐라","audio":"/audio/e5ea2e3c97b86f194395.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734d